        {
          "id": 975320,
          "username": "pborges",
          "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/p/4af34b/{size}.png",
          "created_at": "2023-12-14T00:08:01.000Z",
          "cooked": "<p>When I uploaded my csv file I got:</p>\n<p>The product CSV file that you started importing at December 11, 2023, 9:55 am is now complete.<br>\n1,054 products were successfully imported<br>\n14 products failed to be imported due to invalid information<br>\nTo import products that couldn’t be updated, fix any errors in the CSV file and try importing it again.</p>\n<p>Failed to import:</p>\n<p>Line 89-92: of Option is not unique<br>\nLine 93-94: of Option is not unique<br>\nLine 95-96: of Option is not unique<br>\nLine 97: of Option is not unique<br>\nLine 188: of Option is not unique<br>\nLine 189: of Option is not unique<br>\nLine 263-264: You need to add option values for Size<br>\nLine 442-443: You need to add option values for Size<br>\nLine 473-474: You need to add option values for Size<br>\nLine 1657-1658: of Option is not unique<br>\nLine 1673-1675: of Option is not unique<br>\nLine 1726-1727: The variant ‘Default Title’ already exists.<br>\nLine 1841-1842: The variant ‘Default Title’ already exists.<br>\nLine 1848-1849: The variant ‘Default Title’ already exists.</p>\n<p>But my point is that my csv file does not even have 1849 lines. It only has 1845, so I thin the errors message are not matching the line in the csv file and I can not find the things to fix.</p>\n<p>Is there someone that could help me to understand and fix it?</p>",
