        {
          "id": 1922133,
          "username": "Tubingbing",
          "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/t/74df32/{size}.png",
          "created_at": "2026-10-24T10:27:31.562Z",
          "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/pborges\">@pborges</a> — I found your post where Shopify reported errors on lines 1841–1849 of a CSV that only had 1,845 lines, so you couldn’t find what to fix.</p>\n<p>I’m honest upfront: I’m researching before building anything. I have an idea for a small CSV-checking tool for Shopify merchants, but there is no product yet — nothing to buy, and I’m not selling anything.</p>\n<p>Would you be open to a 15-minute chat about how you import / update products, and the last time a CSV import went wrong? I just want to learn what’s actually painful, so I don’t build the wrong thing.</p>\n<p>Happy to work around your timezone, voice or text — whichever is easier. And if it’s useful, I can share a short summary of what I hear from other merchants (anonymised) once I’ve done a few chats.</p>\n<p>If not, no worries at all — thanks for reading.</p>",
